msgid ""
"First verify that the record you would like to remove is present with the"
" \"datastore_search\" endpoint"
msgstr ""
"Vérifiez d’abord que le dossier que vous voulez supprimer apparaît avec "
"le point de terminaison « datastore_search »."

#: ckanext/recombinant/templates/recombinant/snippets/api_access.html:187
